      "value": "<p><strong>Area Attack.</strong> Each creature within 6 squares rolls <strong>Resolve</strong> vs DC 15. Hit: <code>2d12</code> sephirotic (scrutiny) + soul; half on success. On a failed save, the target is Blinded until end of next turn AND the apotheon gains a Witness-Mark on them (next attack against them has reroll-the-lowest).<br/><em>Recharges on a Soma Break.</em></p><p><em>It blinks. The room becomes briefly, painfully readable.</em></p>",
